# Files listed here will NOT be merged into main when dev is pushed.
# Uses .gitignore syntax: a bare name (no slash) matches that name at ANY depth,
# a leading "/" anchors to the repo root, "dir/" excludes a whole directory, and
# "dir/*" its direct children. Lines starting with # are comments; blanks ignored.

# Keep the auto-merge workflow off main, but DO let release-extension.yml reach
# main — workflow_dispatch's "Run workflow" button only appears for workflows on
# the default branch (main).

.github/workflows/dev-to-main.yml
.dev-files
.instructions.md
.vscode/*
CLAUDE.md
SPEC.md
/cccrouter.json